# Runtime gate 5 child of the LK-repaired, module-policy serviceability
# baseline.  LK devinfo is exposed through its read-only NVMEM provider so the
# existing DVFSP handoff supplier and I2C6 read path can bind.  The DA921x
# observer reuses only the provider's read-only operations and records the two
# selector/enable pairs plus an exact zero register-data-write count.
CONFIG_NVMEM=y
CONFIG_NVMEM_MTK_ATAG_DEVINFO=y
CONFIG_REGULATOR_DA9213_LEGACY_OBSERVER=y
# CONFIG_REGULATOR_DA9213_LEGACY_OBSERVER_KUNIT_TEST is not set
CONFIG_LOCALVERSION="-gemini-da921x-lkro"
